    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGenerator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator</code></a> instance with both these\n<a href=\"#INSTANCES\"><code>delegate</code></a> and the <a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGeneratorDelegates.html#INSTANCES\"><code>core delegates</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个 `<a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGenerator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator</code></a>` 实例，同时包含这两个 `<a href=\"#INSTANCES\"><code>delegate</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGeneratorDelegates.html#INSTANCES\"><code>core delegates</code></a>`。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A list of <a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate</code></a> implementations for the following common bean\ndefinition property value types.\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../support/ManagedList.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>ManagedList</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../support/ManagedSet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>ManagedSet</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../support/ManagedMap.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>ManagedMap</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../config/BeanReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanReference</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../config/TypedStringValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>TypedStringValue</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../config/AutowiredPropertyMarker.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>AutowiredPropertyMarker</code></a></li>\n</ul>\nWhen combined with <a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGeneratorDelegates.html#INSTANCES\">the\ndelegates for common value types</a>, this should be added first as they have\nspecial handling for list, set, and map.",
      "translation": "以下是针对常见 Bean 定义属性值类型的 `<code>ValueCodeGenerator.Delegate</code>` 实现列表。\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../support/ManagedList.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>ManagedList</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../support/ManagedSet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>ManagedSet</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../support/ManagedMap.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>ManagedMap</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>LinkedHashMap</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../config/BeanReference.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanReference</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../config/TypedStringValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>TypedStringValue</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../config/AutowiredPropertyMarker.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>AutowiredPropertyMarker</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n当与<a href=\"../../../aot/generate/ValueCodeGeneratorDelegates.html#INSTANCES\">常见值类型的委托</a>结合使用时，应首先添加这些内容，因为它们对列表、集合和映射具有特殊处理机制。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
